From: Li Guan <guanli.oerv@isrc.iscas.ac.cn>
Subject: [PATCH] Align integration fixtures with the 5.11 live and daemon APIs

The integration tests still expect whole-provider live writes and legacy
Codex authentication routing. Check key-field projections, canonical custom
routes and provider-scoped credentials instead. Configure the fake editor
through AppSettings, and give custom Usage Query fixtures a third-party URL.

The daemon owns its worker independently of the persisted runtime marker.
Check that disabling the last app stops that worker after a failed HTTP
probe; the separate reused-PID tests still cover unrelated processes.

Upstream-Reference: https://github.com/SaladDay/cc-switch-cli/pull/506
Upstream-Reference: https://github.com/SaladDay/cc-switch-cli/pull/508
---
